stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> planned
  planned --> preflight
  preflight --> blocked: missing permission, space, or capability
  preflight --> snapshot: preflight passed
  snapshot --> transfer: snapshot verified
  transfer --> restore: checksummed data copied
  restore --> verify: restore completed
  verify --> ready_for_cutover: health and integrity pass
  verify --> failed: mismatch or health failure
  ready_for_cutover --> cutover: approved window and policy
  cutover --> monitor: DNS/traffic confirmation
  monitor --> completed: acceptance and retention gate passed
  cutover --> rolled_back: approved rollback path
  failed --> rolled_back: recovery evidence available
  blocked --> preflight: blocker resolved
  completed --> [*]
  rolled_back --> [*]
